{
  "meta": {
    "name": "deutsch-prepositions-fa",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "levels": [
      "A1",
      "A2",
      "B1"
    ],
    "note": "Hand-checked A1-B1 German prepositions with Persian glosses. Fields: prepositions: prep, case (akk/dat/wechsel/gen), fa, level, ex, ex_fa. verb_prepositions: verb (infinitive, 'sich X' for reflexive, 'X sein' for copula phrases), prep, case, fa (verb gloss), level, ex, ex_fa, sense (when one verb takes two prepositions with different meanings), sep (separable prefix), forms (explicit Prasens ich/du/er/wir/ihr/sie when not regular weak), lookup_only (true for copula phrases the sentence checker skips). contractions: short form -> prep + article. da_compounds / wo_compounds: compound -> prep. position_verbs / motion_verbs: infinitives for the Wechsel Wo/Wohin rule (forms generated, irregular ones explicit). nouns: singular -> [gender, plural]. destinations: nouns that take zum/zur with motion verbs (nach + dem/der + these is wrong). cities: bare city/country names that take nach (zu + these is wrong)."
  },
